<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from two leading exchange dealers:</p>
<p>			 Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l   Dubai Exchange Int'l</p>
<p> U.S. dollar	 41.85/41.90		 41.83/41.88</p>
<p> Pound sterling    68.15/68.25		 68.20/68.30</p>
<p> Deutsche mark     25.50/25.55		 25.60/25.70</p>
<p> Japanese yen	0.351/0.353		 0.348/0.352</p>
<p> Saudi riyal	 11.14/11.16		 11.15/11.20</p>
<p> UAE dirham	  11.39/11.41		 11.36/11.41</p>
<p> Indian rupee	 1.10/1.12		   1.05/1.10</p>
<p> F.E.B.C.	     4.60/4.80 pct	     4.40/4.60 pct</p>
